---

<section class="welcome" id="about-preview">
  <div class="welcome__card container">
    <figure class="welcome__figure">
      <img
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1496062031456-07b8f162a590?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=70"
        alt="White floral arrangement in soft natural light"
        width="900"
        height="1200"
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </figure>

    <div class="welcome__copy">
      <h2>
        Welcome to Quills and Ink Hub — thoughtful funeral planning and literary
        care for Ghanaian families at home and abroad.
      </h2>
      <p>
        In moments of loss, clarity and dignity matter. We coordinate memorial
        gatherings with cultural sensitivity, and craft eulogies, tributes, and
        programmes that honour a life with grace.
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether you are arranging from Accra or supporting loved ones from the
        diaspora, we walk beside you — calmly, carefully, and with respect.
      </p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about">Read our story</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .welcome {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    margin-top: -5.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .welcome__card {
    display: grid;
    background: var(--color-white);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .welcome__figure {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 22rem;
  }

  .welcome__figure img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .welcome__copy {
    padding: 2.5rem 1.75rem 3rem;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.15rem;
    align-content: center;
  }

  .welcome__copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
  }

  .welcome__copy p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .welcome__copy .text-link {
    justify-self: start;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
  }

  @media (min-width: 880px) {
    .welcome {
      margin-top: -7rem;
      padding-bottom: 0;
    }

    .welcome__card {
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      min-height: 28rem;
    }

    .welcome__copy {
      padding: 3.5rem 3.25rem;
    }

    .welcome__figure {
      transform: translateY(-1.5rem);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
    }
  }
</style>
